<p class="al-text mt-2">Upload your data files, then map your data fields to the Ocean Of Tech FSM fields and then proceed with the import. For more details refer to the <a href="#" class="link-primary">help documentation</a>.</p>

<p class="al-text mt-1">Once the data import is complete, summary of the import will be sent as a email notification.</p>

