<div class="small fw-semibold mt-2">Mandatory Fields</div>

<div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-1 my-2 small">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-dot flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
        <path d="M8 9.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3" />
    </svg>
    <span class="al-text">Import cannot be done without mapping the mandatory field.</span>
</div>


<div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-1 small">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-dot flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
        <path d="M8 9.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3" />
    </svg>
    <span class="al-text">The records will be skipped during import if the mandatory fields are blank in the import file.</span>
</div>


<div class="small fw-semibold mt-3">Addresses Import</div>

<div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-1 my-2 small">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-dot flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
        <path d="M8 9.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3" />
    </svg>
    <span class="al-text">Addresses can be imported to Contacts along with the Contacts data or separately.</span>
</div>


<div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-1 small">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-dot flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
        <path d="M8 9.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3" />
    </svg>
    <span class="al-text">Company ID is a mandatory field to be mapped.</span>
</div>


<div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-1 small">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-dot flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
        <path d="M8 9.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3" />
    </svg>
    <span class="al-text">The data import file should contain as a column a Company ID of the Contacts. This Company ID field is required to link the Addresses to the Contacts record(s).</span>
</div>


